    "message": "release: prepare 0.1.7 version surfaces and changelog\n\nThe user asked to merge the review changes (R22) and the sidebar menu\nfix (R21) and publish a release. Ship everything merged since 0.1.6\n(R17-R22) as the 0.1.7 stable release so installed copies receive it\nthrough the updater. Bump every workspace version surface to 0.1.7 and\nadd the 0.1.7 release notes in all eight locales. The bundled\nmodels.dev snapshot is left unchanged, as in 0.1.5 and 0.1.6.",
